Package: com.andreygirin144-netizen.iconautorefresh
Name: IconAutoRefresh
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Auto-refresh home screen icons without respring.
 Automatically reloads SpringBoard icon cache after installing apps via Sileo, TrollStore Lite, or dpkg. No manual respring or uicache required!
Maintainer: andreygirin144-netizen <andreygirin144@gmail.com>
Author: andreygirin144-netizen
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 15.0)
